      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1410388396,
          "type": null,
          "body": "@johnthacker - we don't know how to decode certain hex 'octet string' parts of the message unless we have a table with matching ranFunctionId, and conversation-data (the table) won't be set until E2setup or E2Update(?) frames are seen.  So this bug could happen whenever those setting-up frames were absent...  We are looking up the table even though there is no ranFunctionID to lookup in this frame, so didn't add any expert info.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6810036,
            "username": "martin.r.mathieson",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Martin Mathieson",
            "state": "active",
